"""Open pad: two bare 0.8 mm square SMD pads, 1.5 mm apart, that a person bridges by hand.

Footprint from the Altium MicrasBluetoothModuleLib "OPENPAD" (designator OP1 on the Micras
Bluetooth module): pads 1 and 2 with mask and paste openings, so reflow tins them, and two
silkscreen arcs around them. No part is placed: the pad pair is excluded from the BOM and the
placement file.
"""

P1 = io(Net)
P2 = io(Net)

Component(
    name="OP",
    prefix="OP",
    symbol=Symbol(library="OpenPad.kicad_sym"),
    footprint=File("OpenPad.kicad_mod"),
    pins={"1": P1, "2": P2},
    skip_bom=True,
    skip_pos=True,
)
